<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US>1</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">．各组要召开专门的推荐会议。要通过个人总结交流，对照评比条件民主评议，采用无记名投票方式，把真正优秀的人选推荐出来；<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US>2</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">．推荐过程中不能论资排辈，不能搞照顾，不能拉票，建议多向班主任、高三教师、竞赛辅导教师、超工作量的教师倾斜；<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US>3</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">．各项先进的人选名单尽量不要重复，其中市直优秀班主任和先进工作者的推荐人选必须要在对应的校级人选中产生，市直班主任推荐人选班主任年限原则上须在<SPAN lang=EN-US>3</SPAN>年以上；<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US>4.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">评比结果将作为“县管校聘”和月度、季度奖金考核发放的依据。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
